  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the centre of a circle which cuts the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> orthogonally and also touches the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> is",
