  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the general equation of circle be<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ....... (i)<br /><br />It cuts the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> orthogonally<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math> .......(ii)<br /><br /><math><mo>∵</mo></math> circle (i) touches <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />therefore,&nbsp; perpendicular distance from centre to the tangent to the circle=radius<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">1</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> ... (iii)<br /><br />on eliminating <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> from (ii) and (iii) we get<br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, locus of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is,<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (replacing <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> &amp; <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> by <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> )",
